.* CMDRCL: Reclaim Commands. Generated by genmenus from the inventories; do not edit.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDRCL'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDRCL HELP=HLPCMDRCL KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Reclaim Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?RCLACTGRP'.Reclaim Activation Group  RCLACTGRP
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?RCLDBXREF'.
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?RCLDDMCNV'.
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?RCLDLO'.
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?RCLLIB'.
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?RCLLNK'.Reclaim Object Links  RCLLNK
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?RCLOBJOWN'.
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?RCLOPT'.
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?RCLRSC'.Reclaim Resources  RCLRSC
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?RCLSPLSTG'.
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?RCLSTG'.Reclaim Storage  RCLSTG
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD ?RCLTMPSTG'.Reclaim Temporary Storage  RCLTMPSTG
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDRCL.Reclaim Commands - Help
:P.Reclaim Commands: every command whose name starts with RCL, in name order, with the command name at the right of its row. The option numbers follow the full command set of the systems this one is compatible with, so a blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command groups.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
